# LF everywhere: provenance sha256s (vendored instruments, golden rows, surface bundle,
# claims registry) must be line-ending-stable across the Windows edit tree and the WSL run tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# never mangle binaries
*.pt binary
*.png binary
